   "content": "I've successfully retrieved the details for all 5 of your reservations. However, I need to let you know that the tools available to me do not include flight duration or detailed layover time information. I can see the flight routes, dates, and prices, but not the actual flight durations.\n\nHere's a summary of what I can tell you about each reservation:\n\n1. **NM1VX1**: Round trip MSP↔EWR (Basic Economy) - May 25-27\n2. **KC18K6**: One-way MSP→CLT via EWR (Basic Economy) - May 21\n3. **S61CZX**: Round trip LAX↔CLT via EWR (Economy) - May 23-25\n4. **H8Q05L**: One-way JFK→ATL (Basic Economy) - May 24\n5. **WUNA5K**: Round trip ORD↔PHL (Economy) - May 10-11\n\nTo get the specific flight duration details you're looking for, I can transfer you to a human agent who may have access to more detailed flight information. Alternatively, if you'd like to tell me which specific reservations you want to cancel or upgrade to business class, I can help you process those changes right away.\n\nWhat would you prefer?",
